    "excerpt": "Industrial, Agriculture, and Water Demand Flexible Re and Deployment Hub (IAW FlexHub) Funder/Agency: California Energy Commission (CEC) Opportun...",
    "bodyText": "Industrial, Agriculture, and Water Demand Flexible Re and Deployment Hub (IAW FlexHub) Funder/Agency: California Energy Commission (CEC) Opportunity Number: GFO-23-316 Description: The purpose of this solicitation is to fund a single re hub administrator who will establish the Industrial, Agricultural, and Water Re and Deployment Hub (IAW FlexHub or Hub) and convene leading re teams to demonstrate and deploy demand flexibility technology solutions for the industrial, agricultural, and water (IAW) sectors. Demand flexibility technologies and strategies are evolving rapidly, and the intent of the IAW FlexHub concept is to allow the hub administrator to dynamically manage re projects based on re results, new policies, and evolving re needs. Pre-Application Workshop CEC staff will hold one Pre-Application Workshop to discuss this solicitation with potential applicants. Participation is optional but encouraged. Tuesday, July 23, 2024 10:00 AM - 12:00 PM Attend the Zoom meeting and enter the Meeting ID below and select “join from your browser.” Participants will then enter the meeting password listed below and their name. Participants will select the “Join” button: Meeting ID: 856 7368 4524 Meeting Password: 325963 Telephone Access Only: Call 1-888 475 4499 (Toll Free) or 1-877 853 5257 (Toll Free). When prompted, enter the meeting number above. International callers may select a number from the Zoom International Dial-in Number List. To comment, dial *9 to “raise your hand” and *6 to mute/unmute your phone line. Eligibility: Business Individual Nonprofit Public Agency Tribal Government Other Legal Entity Award Details: Total Amount Available: $17,000,000 Deadline: Questions Due August 02, 2024 Applications Due October 04, 2024 Opportunity Link Grant Management Associates has years of experience with opportunities like this one. Contact us today for a consultation. Opportunity Title: Rural Energy for America Program (REAP) Funder/Agency: USDA Renewable Energy Systems & Energy Efficiency Improvement... Opportunity Title: Computer and Information Science and Engineering (CISE): Core Programs, Large Projects Funder/Agency: National Science... Opportunity Title: Small Business Innovation Re and Small Business Technology Transfer Programs Phase I Funder/Agency: Department...",
